Built-in ML model (src/lump/data/models/injection-v1.lumpml, also shipped as
extension/models/injection-v1.lumpml)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The model weights were trained on the public datasets below, each used under
its license. Datasets under CC-BY-4.0 and ODC-BY are attributed here as those
licenses require; no dataset text is redistributed in this repository except
the small sets written for this project (src/lump/ml/training/data/,
Apache-2.0): benign hard negatives used in training, and an evaluation set of
reworded attacks plus hard negatives. Exact revisions and file hashes are
pinned in src/lump/ml/training/sources.lock.json.

- deepset/prompt-injections (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/deepset/prompt-injections
- jackhhao/jailbreak-classification (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/jackhhao/jailbreak-classification
- Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions
- TrustAIRLab/in-the-wild-jailbreak-prompts (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/TrustAIRLab/in-the-wild-jailbreak-prompts
- reshabhs/SPML_Chatbot_Prompt_Injection (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/reshabhs/SPML_Chatbot_Prompt_Injection
- nvidia/Nemotron-RL-Agentic-Indirect-Prompt-Injection-v1 (cc-by-4.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-RL-Agentic-Indirect-Prompt-Injection-v1
- nvidia/Nemotron-RL-Jailbreak-Robustness-v1 (cc-by-4.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-RL-Jailbreak-Robustness-v1
- neuralchemy/Prompt-injection-dataset (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/neuralchemy/Prompt-injection-dataset
- Bravansky/compact-jailbreaks (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bravansky/compact-jailbreaks
- djapp18/JailbreaksOverTime (cc-by-4.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/djapp18/JailbreaksOverTime
- OpenAssistant/oasst2 (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/OpenAssistant/oasst2
- HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k
- Open-Orca/OpenOrca (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Open-Orca/OpenOrca
- fka/awesome-chatgpt-prompts (cc0-1.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/awesome-chatgpt-prompts
- microsoft/llmail-inject-challenge (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/microsoft/llmail-inject-challenge
- rgeada/tool-response-injections (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/rgeada/tool-response-injections
- Aditi20/tool-guardrail-dataset (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Aditi20/tool-guardrail-dataset
- glaiveai/glaive-code-assistant (apache-2.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/glaiveai/glaive-code-assistant
- ise-uiuc/Magicoder-OSS-Instruct-75K (mit), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ise-uiuc/Magicoder-OSS-Instruct-75K
- nvidia/OpenCodeInstruct (cc-by-4.0), training: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/OpenCodeInstruct
