- 3nesdeniz/guardrail-hard-negatives (cc-by-4.0), evaluation only (never trained on): https://huggingface.co/datasets/3nesdeniz/guardrail-hard-negatives

Sub-sources carried by the datasets above, as stated on their cards:
- HackAPrompt (CC-BY-4.0), via neuralchemy/Prompt-injection-dataset.
- WildChat user prompts (ODC-BY), via djapp18/JailbreaksOverTime.
- NVIDIA Nemotron datasets and OpenCodeInstruct (CC-BY-4.0): (c) NVIDIA Corporation.
Rows whose upstream licenses are non-commercial, share-alike or unstated were
filtered out (see src/lump/ml/training/sources.py and corpus.py).
Some of these datasets were generated with commercial LLM APIs (for example
Aditi20/tool-guardrail-dataset with Gemini, Magicoder-OSS-Instruct with
GPT-3.5); the model trained on them is a small text classifier, not a
general-purpose language model.

